#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_ai_operations_common.py:0
msgid "You have no properties assigned: there is nothing to show."
msgstr "No tienes hoteles asignados: no hay nada que mostrar."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_board_services_forecast.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(units)s units of %(products)s board service products."
msgstr "%(units)s unidades de %(products)s productos de régimen."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_board_services_forecast.py:0
msgid "Quantity: units of the board service product to prepare on the day, that is the sum of the quantities of the service lines dated that day. The date of a line is the day of consumption, set by the product: a breakfast (consumed after the night) is dated the day after each night, a dinner (consumed before it) the night itself."
msgstr "Cantidad: unidades del producto de régimen que hay que preparar ese día, es decir, la suma de las cantidades de las líneas de servicio con esa fecha. La fecha de una línea es el día de consumo, que fija el producto: un desayuno (se consume después de la noche) lleva la fecha del día siguiente a cada noche; una cena (se consume antes), la de la propia noche."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_board_services_forecast.py:0
msgid "Only board services of reservations that are neither cancelled nor pre-reservations (not confirmed) are counted. Staff stays count; out of service blocks do not."
msgstr "Solo cuentan los regímenes de reservas que no están canceladas ni son prerreservas (sin confirmar). Las estancias de personal cuentan; los bloqueos por fuera de servicio, no."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_board_services_forecast.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "No board service in the period for: %s."
msgstr "Sin regímenes en el periodo en: %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_board_services_forecast.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Units of board services of pre-reservations (not confirmed) are not included: %s."
msgstr "No se incluyen las unidades de régimen de prerreservas (sin confirmar): %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_daily_movements.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(arr)s arrivals (%(arr_in)s already checked in), %(dep)s departures (%(dep_out)s already out) and %(rooms)s rooms with %(pax)s guests in house that night."
msgstr "%(arr)s llegadas (%(arr_in)s ya con check-in), %(dep)s salidas (%(dep_out)s ya fuera) y %(rooms)s habitaciones con %(pax)s huéspedes en casa esa noche."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_daily_movements.py:0
msgid "Arrival: reservation with check-in on the day, in a room for overnight stays and not cancelled. Staff stays count; out of service blocks and pre-reservations (not confirmed) do not."
msgstr "Llegada: reserva con entrada ese día, en una habitación para pernoctar y no cancelada. Las estancias de personal cuentan; los bloqueos por fuera de servicio y las prerreservas (sin confirmar), no."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_daily_movements.py:0
msgid "Checked in: the guests of the reservation have arrived (it is on board, or already out). Pending: still expected; if the day has passed, a no-show not yet cancelled."
msgstr "Con check-in: los huéspedes de la reserva han llegado (está en casa o ya ha salido). Pendiente: aún se la espera; si el día ya ha pasado, es un no-show que no se ha cancelado."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_daily_movements.py:0
msgid "Departure: reservation with check-out on the day. Checked out: already out. Pending: still on board, or never arrived."
msgstr "Salida: reserva con salida ese día. Ya fuera: ha hecho el check-out. Pendiente: sigue en casa o nunca llegó."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_daily_movements.py:0
msgid "In house: reservations with a night on the day (check-in on or before it, check-out after it), whatever their arrival state: rooms are reservations and pax adults plus children."
msgstr "En casa: reservas con una noche ese día (entrada ese día o antes y salida después), sea cual sea su estado de llegada: las habitaciones son reservas y los pax, adultos más niños."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_daily_movements.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Pre-reservations (not confirmed) arriving or leaving on this day are not counted: %s."
msgstr "No se cuentan las prerreservas (sin confirmar) que llegan o salen ese día: %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_folio_reception_note.py:0
msgid "The note is empty."
msgstr "La nota está vacía."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_folio_reception_note.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Post an internal note on the folio %s."
msgstr "Publicar una nota interna en el folio %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_folio_reception_note.py:0
msgid "The note is posted in the chatter of the folio as an internal note, with the name of the user. Nobody is notified and no email is sent."
msgstr "La nota se publica en el chatter del folio como nota interna, con el nombre del usuario. No se avisa a nadie ni se envía ningún correo."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_folio_reception_note.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Internal note posted on the folio %s."
msgstr "Nota interna publicada en el folio %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_folio_reception_note.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "No folio found with the id or code %s."
msgstr "No se ha encontrado ningún folio con el id o código %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_folio_reception_note.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Several folios have the code %s: use the id of the folio."
msgstr "Hay varios folios con el código %s: usa el id del folio."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_guest_data_pending.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(guests)s guests in %(folios)s folios (%(reservations)s of %(arrivals)s arriving reservations) still have to complete their check-in data between %(date_from)s and %(date_to)s."
msgstr "%(guests)s huéspedes en %(folios)s folios (%(reservations)s de %(arrivals)s reservas que llegan) aún tienen que completar sus datos de check-in entre el %(date_from)s y el %(date_to)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_guest_data_pending.py:0
msgid "Arrivals: normal reservations with check-in in the period, in a room for overnight stays, confirmed and not cancelled (also those on board with only some of the guests in). Staff stays, out of service blocks and pre-reservations (not confirmed) are left out."
msgstr "Llegadas: reservas normales con entrada en el periodo, en una habitación para pernoctar, confirmadas y no canceladas (también las que están en casa con solo parte de los huéspedes dentro). Se dejan fuera las estancias de personal, los bloqueos por fuera de servicio y las prerreservas (sin confirmar)."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_guest_data_pending.py:0
msgid "A guest has pending data when the check-in record has no data at all (unknown guest) or lacks some mandatory field (incomplete data): the pre-check-in is not done."
msgstr "Un huésped tiene datos pendientes cuando su ficha de check-in no tiene ningún dato (huésped desconocido) o le falta algún campo obligatorio (datos incompletos): el precheck-in no está hecho."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_guest_data_pending.py:0
msgid "Missing: the mandatory fields, such as the identity document, that the incomplete guests of the folio still lack. Holders are shown as first name and initial."
msgstr "Faltan: los campos obligatorios, como el documento de identidad, que aún les faltan a los huéspedes incompletos del folio. Los titulares se muestran con nombre e inicial."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(overbooked)s property days overbooked and %(high)s more at %(pct)s%% or above between %(date_from)s and %(date_to)s."
msgstr "%(overbooked)s días-hotel con overbooking y %(high)s más al %(pct)s%% o por encima entre el %(date_from)s y el %(date_to)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
msgid "Occupied: nights of normal and staff reservations in active rooms for overnight stays. Pre-reservations (not confirmed) and cancelled reservations are not counted."
msgstr "Ocupadas: noches de reservas normales y de personal en habitaciones activas para pernoctar. No cuentan las prerreservas (sin confirmar) ni las reservas canceladas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
msgid "Blocked: nights of out of service blocks. Available: rooms that are neither occupied nor blocked."
msgstr "Bloqueadas: noches de bloqueos por fuera de servicio. Disponibles: habitaciones que no están ni ocupadas ni bloqueadas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
msgid "Rooms: active rooms for overnight stays today (the count of past dates uses today's rooms). Occupancy: occupied nights over rooms, as in the Alda KPIs, so blocked rooms are not taken out of the denominator."
msgstr "Habitaciones: habitaciones activas para pernoctar hoy (en fechas pasadas se cuentan las de hoy). Ocupación: noches ocupadas entre habitaciones, como en los KPI de Alda, así que las bloqueadas no se restan del denominador."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Room nights of pre-reservations (not confirmed) in the period are not counted: %s."
msgstr "No se cuentan las noches de prerreservas (sin confirmar) del periodo: %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Flag high: occupancy at %s%% or more. Flag overbooking: more rooms used (occupied plus blocked) than the property has; above 100%% occupancy the PMS allows overbooking."
msgstr "Marca alta: ocupación del %s%% o más. Marca overbooking: más habitaciones usadas (ocupadas más bloqueadas) de las que tiene el hotel; por encima del 100%% de ocupación el PMS permite overbooking."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_operations/models/pms_occupancy_outlook.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%s has no rooms for overnight stays."
msgstr "%s no tiene habitaciones para pernoctar."
